{"seq":2,"slug":"ongoing-linkage-monitoring-rerun","title":"持续关联监控与新证据重算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-lifecycle-integration/ongoing-linkage-monitoring-rerun","wordCount":2098,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"持续关联监控与新证据重算\">持续关联监控与新证据重算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>入驻预检只能拦住注册时刻已存在关联的情形。大量逃逸是在运营过程中形成的：两个店铺注册时毫无交集，半年后开始共用仓库、共用收款账户、互相转账。本节讲持续监控的触发机制、增量重算的调度，以及如何避免全量重跑带来的成本爆炸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种触发机制\">三种触发机制</h2><p>持续监控不能靠定时全量扫描，那在百万级店铺上不可行。真实可用的触发来自三个事件源：</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发源对照\">触发源对照</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发源</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>立即动作</th>\n<th>延迟要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号变更</td>\n<td>新设备绑定、收款账户变更、责任人变更</td>\n<td>局部重算受影响簇</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处置事件</td>\n<td>店铺被封禁、限流、警告</td>\n<td>邻域扫描找迁移店</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期扫描</td>\n<td>定时任务（日/周）</td>\n<td>全量指标与低优先簇重评</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投诉举报</td>\n<td>卖家/买家举报关联</td>\n<td>定向核查指定店铺对</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"信号变更与处置事件的区别\">信号变更与处置事件的区别</h3><p>前两类的区别很重要。<strong>信号变更</strong>是图谱自身的数据变化，处理方式是识别这条新边连接的两个节点各自的簇，只对这两个簇做局部重算。<strong>处置事件</strong>不是数据变化而是状态变化，它触发的是<a href=\"../multistore-policy-legit-exception/linkage-evasion-motivation\">关联逃逸动机</a> 中描述的「封禁后迁移」扫描——查被封主体的关联邻域中近期活跃度异常上升的店铺。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;事件进入&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;事件类型?&quot;}&#10;  B -- 信号变更 --&gt; C[&quot;定位受影响的两个簇&quot;]&#10;  B -- 处置事件 --&gt; D[&quot;取被封主体的关联邻域&quot;]&#10;  B -- 周期/举报 --&gt; E[&quot;按分片全量或定向&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;局部重算: 重跑簇内聚类&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;邻域扫描: 生成迁移候选&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;队列化批处理&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I[&quot;簇结构变更检测&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{&quot;新证据达等级门槛?&quot;}&#10;  J -- 是 --&gt; K[&quot;生成候选 → 第3章证据分级&quot;]&#10;  J -- 否 --&gt; L[&quot;更新簇分数, 不改状态&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"事件进入\"] --&gt; B{\"事件类型?\"}\n  B -- 信号变更 --&gt; C[\"定位受影响的两个簇\"]\n  B -- 处置事件 --&gt; D[\"取被封主体的关联邻域\"]\n  B -- 周期/举报 --&gt; E[\"按分片全量或定向\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"局部重算: 重跑簇内聚类\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"邻域扫描: 生成迁移候选\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"队列化批处理\"]\n  F --&gt; I[\"簇结构变更检测\"]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{\"新证据达等级门槛?\"}\n  J -- 是 --&gt; K[\"生成候选 → 第3章证据分级\"]\n  J -- 否 --&gt; L[\"更新簇分数, 不改状态\"]</pre><h2 id=\"增量重算的算法\">增量重算的算法</h2><p>局部重算的核心是限定计算范围。给定一条新边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 连接节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，受影响的节点集合是它们所属簇的并集加上一跳邻域：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>affected</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Cluster</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mtext>Cluster</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Cluster</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mtext>Cluster</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{affected}} = \\text{Cluster}(u) \\cup \\text{Cluster}(v) \\cup N_1(\\text{Cluster}(u) \\cup \\text{Cluster}(v))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">affected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cluster</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cluster</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cluster</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cluster</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>计算只在这个子图上重跑聚类。子图规模通常远小于全图，因此增量重算的耗时可以在秒级完成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"簇稳定性的约束\">簇稳定性的约束</h3><p>但简单的「重跑子图聚类」会破坏簇的稳定性——同一条边反复重算可能得到不同的划分，导致簇 ID 飘忽，处置历史断裂。解决方案是<strong>以强边锚点固定簇身份</strong>，把重算限制在锚点不变的前提下调整弱边的归属。</p>\n<p>局部重算在算法上的可行前提，是聚类启发式对初始划分不敏感。以模块度优化类的 Louvain 方法为例，它通过迭代把节点并入使模块度增益最大的邻接社区来提取结构，其原始论文在含 260 万客户与 1.18 亿节点的图上演示了可扩展性（来源：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/0803.0476\">Blondel et al., arXiv:0803.0476</a>）。这种「局部贪心 + 迭代」的性质意味着在子图上以原划分热启动，通常能收敛到与原簇接近的结果，这正是增量重算能保持簇稳定的理论依据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def incremental_recluster(graph, new_edge, cluster_store):&#10;    u, v = new_edge.src, new_edge.dst&#10;    cu = cluster_store.cluster_of(u)&#10;    cv = cluster_store.cluster_of(v)&#10;&#10;    if cu is None and cv is None:&#10;        return None                       # 全新孤立边, 等聚齐信号再处理&#10;&#10;    # 合并情形: 两个已有簇被新边连通&#10;    if cu is not None and cv is not None and cu.id != cv.id:&#10;        merged = merge_clusters(graph, cu, cv)&#10;        if merged.anchor_conflict:        # 两簇强边锚点互斥 -&gt; 不合并, 标记对抗&#10;            return mark_contested(cu, cv, new_edge)&#10;        return commit_merge(merged)&#10;&#10;    # 扩展情形: 新节点并入已有簇&#10;    target = cu or cv&#10;    if graph.edge_weight(new_edge) &lt; target.min_edge_weight:&#10;        target.add_edge(new_edge, state=&quot;pending&quot;)   # 低权重边先挂起&#10;        return None&#10;    candidate = resegment(graph.subgraph(target.nodes + graph.neighbors(target.nodes, 1)))&#10;    return commit_evolution(target, candidate)        # 记录演化而非改名\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> incremental_recluster</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(graph, new_edge, cluster_store):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u, v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_edge.src, new_edge.dst</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_store.cluster_of(u)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_store.cluster_of(v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                       # 全新孤立边, 等聚齐信号再处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 合并情形: 两个已有簇被新边连通</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cu.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv.id:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        merged </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merge_clusters(graph, cu, cv)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merged.anchor_conflict:        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 两簇强边锚点互斥 -> 不合并, 标记对抗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mark_contested(cu, cv, new_edge)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commit_merge(merged)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 扩展情形: 新节点并入已有簇</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cu </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.edge_weight(new_edge) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target.min_edge_weight:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        target.add_edge(new_edge, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 低权重边先挂起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    candidate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resegment(graph.subgraph(target.nodes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph.neighbors(target.nodes, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commit_evolution(target, candidate)        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 记录演化而非改名</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段逻辑包含三个关键决策。<strong>孤立边挂起</strong>：一条不连接任何已有簇的边不立即成簇，避免为单路弱信号建立无意义的簇记录。<strong>锚点冲突处理</strong>：若两个簇各自有互斥的强边锚点（例如两个不同的 UBO），新边不能把它们合并，而应标记为「对抗簇」等待人工判断——这类情形往往意味着代持或数据错误。<strong>演化而非改名</strong>：簇结构变化时保留原 ID 并记录一次演化事件，使处置与申诉的历史保持连续。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个决策的取舍依据\">三个决策的取舍依据</h3><p>孤立边挂起牺牲了发现速度换取干净的簇结构；锚点冲突处理把无法自动裁决的情形交给人工而非强行合并；演化而非改名保证了下游的处置与申诉不会因簇 ID 变化而断裂。三者共同服务于一个目标：让簇成为稳定的、可被治理流程引用的对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"簇演化记录\">簇演化记录</h2><p>簇的生命周期需要可追溯，否则「为什么昨天这个簇只有两家店，今天变成五家」这类问题无法回答。演化事件表是必要的基础设施。</p>\n<h3 id=\"演化事件表结构\">演化事件表结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE cluster_evolution (&#10;  evo_id        BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  cluster_id    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  event_type    TEXT NOT NULL,     -- created|edge_added|split|merged|anchor_conflict&#10;  prev_members  BIGINT[],&#10;  new_members   BIGINT[],&#10;  trigger_edge  JSONB,             -- {src,dst,signal_type,weight}&#10;  trigger_event TEXT,              -- signal_change | enforcement | periodic&#10;  tier_before   TEXT,&#10;  tier_after    TEXT,&#10;  occurred_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_evo_cluster ON cluster_evolution(cluster_id, occurred_at DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cluster_evolution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evo_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cluster_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- created|edge_added|split|merged|anchor_conflict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prev_members  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  new_members   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_edge  JSONB,             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {src,dst,signal_type,weight}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- signal_change | enforcement | periodic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier_before   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier_after    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_evo_cluster</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_evolution(cluster_id, occurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>tier_before</code> 与 <code>tier_after</code> 字段让演化记录可以直接回答「这次变化是否导致了证据等级跃迁」。若一次演化把簇从 L4 提升到 L2，它应当自动产生一个待处置候选；若只是 L4 内部的小幅波动，则仅更新分数。这个映射关系是 <a href=\"../linkage-evidence-adjudication/linkage-confidence-evidence-tier\">证据分级</a> 门槛机制的运行时体现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"等级跃迁作为候选生成器\">等级跃迁作为候选生成器</h3><p>把等级跃迁作为候选生成的唯一入口，可以避免「每次重算都开单」的噪声。演化记录因此不只是审计日志，它是候选生成的驱动表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态跃迁的告警抑制\">状态跃迁的告警抑制</h2><p>持续监控的常见失败模式不是漏报，而是<strong>告警风暴</strong>：同一簇在短时间内因大量信号变更被反复重算，每次都触发一次通知，把复核队列淹没。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层抑制手段\">三层抑制手段</h3><p>控制手段有三层。第一层是<strong>同一簇的去重窗口</strong>：一个簇在 N 小时内只产生一条待处置记录，后续变化合并进同一条记录的证据快照。第二层是<strong>等级跃迁才告警</strong>：簇分数在等级内波动不触发通知，只有跨等级（尤其跨越 L2 门槛）才产生告警。这一条把告警量与「实质性变化」对齐。第三层是<strong>优先级排序</strong>：待处置队列按簇分数 × 违规严重度排序，让有限的人工复核资源优先处理高危簇，其余按容量处理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抑制机制</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>去重窗口</td>\n<td>同簇重复事件</td>\n<td>24h 窗口</td>\n<td>窗口内快速恶化被延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等级跃迁告警</td>\n<td>分数波动</td>\n<td>仅跨级触发</td>\n<td>临界附近的连续跃迁仍会告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级排序</td>\n<td>队列顺序</td>\n<td>分数 × 严重度</td>\n<td>低优簇长期积压</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>去重窗口的延迟风险必须正视：若一个簇在 24 小时窗口内从 L4 快速恶化为 L1（例如突然出现同一收款账户），延迟处置会放过关键窗口。折中做法是<strong>允许高危信号穿透去重窗口</strong>——L1 级信号直接产生即时告警，不参与窗口合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从监控到处置的衔接\">从监控到处置的衔接</h2><p>持续监控产出的候选进入 <a href=\"../linkage-evidence-adjudication/linkage-confidence-evidence-tier\">证据分级</a> 与 <a href=\"../linkage-evidence-adjudication/linked-store-enforcement-ladder\">处置梯度</a> 的流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"已处置簇的复检\">已处置簇的复检</h3><p>这里要强调的是<strong>已处置簇的复检</strong>：一个已被限流的簇若持续收到新证据，说明处置不足或卖家在对抗性演化；一个已被判定为误伤并恢复的簇若再次出现强信号，则应提高敏感度而非重复同样的处置路径。复检状态需要一个显式标记，否则系统会对同一个已知误伤模式反复开单。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;cluster_id&quot;: &quot;clu_a91f3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;monitoring_state&quot;: &quot;recheck_after_revoke&quot;,&#10;  &quot;last_outcome&quot;: &quot;revoked&quot;,&#10;  &quot;revoke_reason&quot;: &quot;third_party_warehouse_shared&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sensitivity&quot;: &quot;elevated_signal_weight&quot;,&#10;  &quot;suppressed_signals&quot;: [&quot;same_return_address&quot;],&#10;  &quot;next_review_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-28T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;notes&quot;: &quot;该簇的退货地址信号已被证明来自第三方服务商, 复检时不再单独作为证据&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cluster_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clu_a91f3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"monitoring_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recheck_after_revoke\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"last_outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"revoked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"revoke_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"third_party_warehouse_shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sensitivity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"elevated_signal_weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suppressed_signals\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_return_address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"next_review_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-28T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"notes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"该簇的退货地址信号已被证明来自第三方服务商, 复检时不再单独作为证据\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>suppressed_signals</code> 字段是申诉回流的具体应用：已被证明无判别力的信号在复检时被抑制，避免重复开单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持续监控由四类触发驱动：信号变更、处置事件、周期扫描、投诉举报；前两类是主力，周期扫描只负责重评低优先簇。</li>\n<li>增量重算把计算限定在新边两端簇及其一跳邻域的子图上，通常可在秒级完成。</li>\n<li>三个关键决策：孤立边先挂起、锚点互斥时标记对抗簇而非强行合并、簇结构变化记录演化事件而非改名。</li>\n<li>簇演化记录需携带等级前后值，使「是否发生等级跃迁」可直接查询并驱动候选生成。</li>\n<li>告警风暴靠去重窗口、等级跃迁告警、优先级排序三层抑制，但 L1 级信号应穿透去重窗口以免延迟关键处置。</li>\n<li>已处置与已撤销的簇需要复检状态与抑制信号清单，避免对已知误伤模式反复开单。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关阅读：入驻时的预检见<a href=\"onboarding-linkage-precheck\">入驻环节关联预检</a>，监控效果如何度量见<a href=\"linkage-governance-falsepositive-metric\">关联治理覆盖率/误伤/复发度量</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"持续关联监控与新证据重算","id":"持续关联监控与新证据重算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种触发机制","id":"三种触发机制"},{"level":3,"text":"触发源对照","id":"触发源对照"},{"level":3,"text":"信号变更与处置事件的区别","id":"信号变更与处置事件的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"增量重算的算法","id":"增量重算的算法"},{"level":3,"text":"簇稳定性的约束","id":"簇稳定性的约束"},{"level":3,"text":"三个决策的取舍依据","id":"三个决策的取舍依据"},{"level":2,"text":"簇演化记录","id":"簇演化记录"},{"level":3,"text":"演化事件表结构","id":"演化事件表结构"},{"level":3,"text":"等级跃迁作为候选生成器","id":"等级跃迁作为候选生成器"},{"level":2,"text":"状态跃迁的告警抑制","id":"状态跃迁的告警抑制"},{"level":3,"text":"三层抑制手段","id":"三层抑制手段"},{"level":2,"text":"从监控到处置的衔接","id":"从监控到处置的衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"已处置簇的复检","id":"已处置簇的复检"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"入驻环节关联预检（联026/175）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-lifecycle-integration/onboarding-linkage-precheck"},"next":{"title":"关联治理覆盖率/误伤/复发度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-lifecycle-integration/linkage-governance-falsepositive-metric"}}